                                "sense_id": "628ff88f-15ea-3fec-95c7-6991510ebf2b",
                                "text": "The Lady Powis […] patted him with her fan, and called him a cowhearted fellow."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5c7a1e4e-cc67-423c-aee3-08407cd8c788",
                                "sense_id": "628ff88f-15ea-3fec-95c7-6991510ebf2b",
                                "text": "Pfhaw, I Cow-hearted! I'm as bold as a Lyon!"
                            },
                            {
