                                "sense_id": "628ff88f-15ea-3fec-95c7-6991510ebf2b",
                                "text": "“You're a cowhearted rascal, that's sure, but you didn't try to use anything that belonged to me. So you can go. That's what I wouldn't ever want to happen,” he continued, speaking very slowly"
